===Etymology===
From {{der|en|enm|Ebreu}}, from {{der|en|fro|Ebreu}}, from {{der|en|la|hebraeus}} or {{m|la|hebraicus}}, from {{der|en|grc|Ἑβραῖος}}, from {{der|en|arc|עִבְרַי|tr=ʿiḇray}}, from {{der|en|he|עִבְרִי|tr=ʿiḇrī́}}.

