===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[member]] or [[descendant]] of a [[Semite|Semitic]] [[people]] claiming descent from [[Abraham]], [[Isaac]], and [[Jacob]].
# {{lb|en|countable}} A [[descendant]] of the [[biblical]] [[Patriarch]] [[Eber]].
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The [[Semitic]] [[language]] spoken by the Hebrew people.
# {{lb|en|uncountable}} The writing system used in Hebrew language.
# {{lb|en|uncountable|colloquial}} [[unintelligible|Unintelligible]] speech or writing.

